  "sourceInterpretation": "S31 sec_ll.h at274d7ebeaf15cf397347877c34816ea9470d153f gives XTAL/RC_FAST/PLL_F240M selectors0/1/2; oldfff9895c source has no sec_ll.h. Both revisions of register fields retained. Image private v6.1-dirty revision unknown. Exact source agreement does not claim silicon validation.",
  "semantics": {
    "roots": "Selected XTAL40MHz, powered nominal RC_FAST17.5MHz, or supplied stableBBPLL through REF_240M gate/divisor+1. Resetref0x101 gives240MHz from480MHz. Reservedselector3rejected.",
    "sha": "Actual supported block digest computed synchronously. Root absence/gating prevents accesses. Existing SHA parent/reset gates preserved; no latency/analog calibration claim.",
    "keyManager": "Own sys/core/reset word,documented cold defaults,oneway perfield locks,readonlyIDLE/noresult/invalidkeys. PermissionHP_PERI0+6c enforced. Reset restores register defaults perLLreset_register;no operation accepted.",
    "keyOperations": "START/CONTINUE return explicitProhibited. Unimplemented key material/data paths unmapped. No derivedkey,validbit,interruptcompletion or successfabricated. ChoosingeFusekey is configuration only.",
    "unsupported": [
      "Key generation/deployment,secureboot,Flash/PSRAMencryption",
      "PMUsleep/wakeup sequence atnextactualread20704158",
      "Plusdisplay/boardreadiness",
      "Measuredcrypto clocklatency or siliconresetdomainverification"
    ]
  },
